diff --git a/text/usascii/p1_smt_unit_probe.txt b/text/usascii/p1_smt_unit_probe.txt
new file mode 100644
index 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000..316f22f5733e7dec3640cf5d5b5099243bafc7e9
--- /dev/null
+++ b/text/usascii/p1_smt_unit_probe.txt
@@ -0,0 +1,88 @@
+P1_SMT_UNIT_LABEL
+p1_smt_unit_probe
+
+
+P1_SMT_UNIT_HELP
+Read units and convert a thickness sample for one planar face.
+
+
+P1_SMT_UNIT_DESC
+Read-only unit probe. Input mm and report conversion to model units.
+
+
+P1_SMT_UNIT_NO_MODEL
+No active model. Open a part and retry.
+
+
+P1_SMT_UNIT_NOT_PART
+Only an active part is supported; assemblies and drawings are rejected.
+
+
+P1_SMT_UNIT_NO_BODY
+No usable default solid body. No feature was created.
+
+
+P1_SMT_UNIT_ALREADY
+Default body is already sheetmetal; this probe requires a solid part.
+
+
+P1_SMT_UNIT_SELECT
+Select one planar surface belonging to the default body.
+
+
+P1_SMT_UNIT_NO_FACE
+No surface selected. Select one planar driving surface and retry.
+
+
+P1_SMT_UNIT_ONE_FACE
+Select exactly one surface. No feature was created.
+
+
+P1_SMT_UNIT_BAD_FACE
+Invalid surface or geometry query failed. No feature was created.
+
+
+P1_SMT_UNIT_BODY_MISMATCH
+Surface is not confirmed in the default body. No feature was created.
+
+
+P1_SMT_UNIT_NOT_PLANE
+6A supports planar driving surfaces only. No feature was created.
+
+
+P1_SMT_UNIT_THICKNESS
+Enter a thickness sample in mm (0.1 to 20.0). Press ESC to cancel.
+
+
+P1_SMT_UNIT_BAD_THICKNESS
+Thickness must be a finite number from 0.1 to 20.0 mm.
+
+
+P1_SMT_UNIT_CANCELLED
+Unit probe cancelled.
+
+
+P1_SMT_UNIT_STALE
+Model or default body changed. No feature was created; retry selection.
+
+
+P1_SMT_UNIT_UNIT_FAILED
+Could not confirm mm to current model units. No feature was created.
+
+
+P1_SMT_UNIT_QUERY_FAILED
+Model or body query failed. No feature was created.
+
+
+P1_SMT_UNIT_BUSY
+The unit probe is already active.
+
+
+P1_SMT_UNIT_EXCEPTION
+Unit probe exception. Inspect the JSONL log before retrying.
+
+
+P1_SMT_UNIT_STOPPED
+Unit calculation complete. Probe stopped. Check the JSONL log.
+
+
